UrnaEmu — licensing
===================

UrnaEmu's own source code (everything in this repository that is not listed
under "Third-party and vendored components" below) is released into the public
domain under The Unlicense, reproduced at the end of this file.

This dedication applies ONLY to UrnaEmu's own code. The components below are
not ours and keep their own licenses and terms:

- VOTA and the Simulador de Votação data (in static/vendor/: the VOTA
  WebAssembly application, the RHVoice synthesized voice, the text fonts, and
  the scenario data) come from the Tribunal Superior Eleitoral (TSE) and are
  redistributed unchanged. They belong to the TSE. UrnaEmu is an independent
  project with no link to or endorsement by the TSE or the Justiça Eleitoral,
  and the inclusion of these files here does not imply any authorization. They
  may be taken down upon request by the TSE or another competent authority; to
  request this, get in touch via https://github.com/rlaneth/urnaemu/issues.
- The text fonts (Inter, Manrope, Source Serif 4, Atkinson Hyperlegible) are
  under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- The "Vote" icon used in the logo and favicon is from Lucide, under the ISC
  License (https://lucide.dev).
- Build-time libraries (Svelte, SvelteKit, Vite, bits-ui) are under the MIT
  License.

The same summary is shown in the application under Ajuda › Licenças.

